Z||000000||CoolBlue87GT||06-22-2001||06:24 PM||||Was wondering, anyone still have their original battery ?<P>Was wondering if anyone has pic's of one.<P>Mine died a few years ago, and can't remember what they look like.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||06-22-2001||06:28 PM||||I replaced mine 2 months ago. It was in dire need of replacement.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>It was black and the terminals were attached by screwing them in the battery (please, do not turn that single sentence into another huge thread). It had a small round clear plastic window on top. If it was green, the battery was ok. If it was black it needed replacement. In fact, I believe they are still being made. I've had the same type of battery in all my Fieros so I think it's the original.||||reg||1
Z||000002||CoolBlue87GT||06-22-2001||07:01 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cliff Pennock:<BR><B>I've had the same type of battery in all my Fieros so I think it's the original.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks,<BR>I stopped by a AutoZone store, they have one ac delco side mount one the clearance shelf that is listed for the Fiero. It does have the glass site.<P>Since I enter as Factory original class, wanted to see if anyone knew if it looked like the current ac delco. <BR>Thanks again.<BR>||||reg||1
